---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { u } from '../lib/url';
import SectionBreath from '../components/SectionBreath.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="For public administration · Thorn Industries"
  description="Digitalisation for Romanian city halls, county councils and local public services. We tell you which funding lines you qualify for now, we run procurement properly, and you get one named person who answers for the work."
  lang="en"
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="surface-light pt-12 md:pt-20 pb-16 md:pb-24">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-y-8 md:gap-x-10">
        <div class="md:col-span-9">
          <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-8 md:mb-10">
            <span class="font-mono">001</span>
            <span class="mx-3 text-ink-300">·</span>
            For public administration
          </div>
          <h1 class="font-sans font-medium text-display-1 text-ink-900 hang tracking-tight">
            The money is there.<br/>
            <span class="text-ink-400">The strategy usually isn't.</span>
          </h1>
        </div>

        <aside class="md:col-span-3 md:pt-32 md:border-l md:border-forest-100 md:pl-6">
          <div class="eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-3">Audience</div>
          <div class="text-ink-900 text-body-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            City halls<br/>
            County councils<br/>
            Local public services
          </div>

          <div class="eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-3">Coverage</div>
          <div class="text-ink-900 text-body-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Romania-wide
          </div>

          <div class="eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-3">Primary contact</div>
          <div class="text-ink-900 text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
            Ioana Drăghici
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 md:mt-16 max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-body-lg text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
          PNRR Component 7. Regional Programme Nord-Vest. DigiLocal. NIS2 compliance funding. Hundreds of millions of euros are allocated to local government digitalisation. Much of it goes unspent, or gets spent badly, because the road from "we need to digitalise" to "here is a well-built project that wins the grant" is longer than it looks.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The 3-step path -->
  <section class="surface-medium section">
    <div class="container-page">

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 mb-12 md:mb-16">
        <div class="md:col-span-4">
          <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-3">002 · Engagement</div>
          <h2 class="font-sans font-medium text-display-2 text-ink-900 leading-tight tracking-tight hang">
            Three steps.<br/>
            <span class="text-ink-400">Three contracts.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-8 md:pt-4">
          <p class="text-body-lg text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
            Each step is a separate contract, awarded through a proper procedure. No contract splitting, no surprises, and nothing ties you to step two until step one gives you something useful.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">

        <article class="card-secondary">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-10">
            <div class="md:col-span-3 flex flex-col">
              <div class="step-numeral-lg mb-4">01</div>
              <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700">Digitalisation assessment</div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-6">
              <p class="text-ink-800 text-body leading-relaxed mb-5">
                One to three days with you, on site. You get a written report of 15 to 25 pages that your local council can read and discuss. We tell you which funding lines you qualify for now, and what can realistically be done next.
              </p>
              <dl class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-body-sm">
                <div>
                  <dt class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-1">Duration</dt>
                  <dd class="text-ink-900">1-3 weeks</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-1">Fee</dt>
                  <dd class="text-ink-900">Fixed</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-1">Procurement</dt>
                  <dd class="text-ink-900">Single</dd>
                </div>
              </dl>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-3 md:pl-6 md:border-l md:border-forest-100">
              <div class="eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-2">Deliverable</div>
              <p class="text-ink-700 text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
                A written report: findings, an action plan, recommendations. Interventions come in priority order, each one costed and set against its procurement threshold.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card-secondary">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-10">
            <div class="md:col-span-3 flex flex-col">
              <div class="step-numeral-lg mb-4">02</div>
              <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700">Grant application</div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-6">
              <p class="text-ink-800 text-body leading-relaxed mb-5">
                If the assessment finds a funding line that fits, we write the technical sections of the grant application. Your team submits it, or we submit it together, depending on what the procedure allows.
              </p>
              <dl class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-body-sm">
                <div>
                  <dt class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-1">Duration</dt>
                  <dd class="text-ink-900">2-4 weeks</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-1">Fee</dt>
                  <dd class="text-ink-900">Fixed</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-1">Stage</dt>
                  <dd class="text-ink-900">Optional</dd>
                </div>
              </dl>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-3 md:pl-6 md:border-l md:border-forest-100">
              <div class="eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-2">Deliverable</div>
              <p class="text-ink-700 text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
                The technical sections of the application. Project plan. Compliance documentation.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card-secondary">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-10">
            <div class="md:col-span-3 flex flex-col">
              <div class="step-numeral-lg mb-4">03</div>
              <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700">Implementation</div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-6">
              <p class="text-ink-800 text-body leading-relaxed mb-5">
                When the money is in the account, we start. One team and one named technical lead who stays on the project from the first day to handover. Year-one maintenance is part of the contract.
              </p>
              <dl class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-body-sm">
                <div>
                  <dt class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-1">Duration</dt>
                  <dd class="text-ink-900">3-9 months</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-1">Contract</dt>
                  <dd class="text-ink-900">Single</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-1">SEAP</dt>
                  <dd class="text-ink-900">The right procedure</dd>
                </div>
              </dl>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-3 md:pl-6 md:border-l md:border-forest-100">
              <div class="eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-2">Deliverable</div>
              <p class="text-ink-700 text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
                Working system, documentation, operating manuals, year-one maintenance.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Funding lines - dark inversion -->
  <section class="surface-dark section">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 mb-12 md:mb-16">
        <div class="md:col-span-4">
          <div class="eyebrow text-forest-300 mb-3">003 · Funding context</div>
          <h2 class="font-sans font-medium text-display-2 text-cream-50 leading-tight tracking-tight hang">
            What you can<br/>fund now.
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-8 md:pt-4">
          <p class="text-body-lg text-cream-100/80 leading-relaxed">
            The rules change every few months. This is where things stand today. We update it as application windows open and close.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="card-secondary">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-forest-700">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg text-cream-50 tracking-tight">DigiLocal (OUG 56/2024)</h3>
            <div class="font-mono tabular text-eyebrow text-forest-300">75K-175K RON</div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-cream-100/80 text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
            Direct grants for digitalisation in communes. Application windows follow the calendar set out in the OUG. The most accessible funding line at the moment for smaller administrations.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-secondary">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-forest-700">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg text-cream-50 tracking-tight">PNRR Component 7</h3>
            <div class="font-mono tabular text-eyebrow text-forest-300">In the millions</div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-cream-100/80 text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
            The "digital transformation" package. Tighter eligibility, a longer application, a bigger scope. Suited to cities and counties that already have a digitalisation strategy, or are close to one.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-secondary">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-forest-700">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg text-cream-50 tracking-tight">PR Nord-Vest 2021-2027</h3>
            <div class="font-mono tabular text-eyebrow text-forest-300">Per project</div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-cream-100/80 text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
            Regional operational programme for Cluj, Bistrița-Năsăud, Maramureș, Sălaj, Satu Mare and Bihor counties. Smart specialisation, modernising public administration, services for citizens.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-secondary">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-forest-700">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg text-cream-50 tracking-tight">NIS2 (Law 124/2025)</h3>
            <div class="font-mono tabular text-eyebrow text-forest-300">By category</div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-cream-100/80 text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
            Administrations classified as "essential entities" under NIS2 have compliance deadlines that carry the force of law. Dedicated funding lines are announced through DNSC. Worth finding out your classification before the deadline ends up standing in for a strategy.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SectionBreath label="Common questions" tone="light" />

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="surface-light section">
    <div class="container-page">

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 mb-12 md:mb-16">
        <div class="md:col-span-4">
          <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-3">004 · FAQ</div>
          <h2 class="font-sans font-medium text-display-2 text-ink-900 leading-tight tracking-tight hang">
            What people ask<br/>us most.
          </h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="border-t border-forest-100 pt-8">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-xl text-ink-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
              "We already have Regista / Avansis / CityManager. Why do we need anything else?"
            </h3>
            <p class="text-ink-700 text-body leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
              You probably don't need anything else. You need the system you already have to talk to ANAF, to the cadastre, to your accounting records, and to the reports the mayor actually reads. Most of our work with city halls is integration and a data layer, not replacement.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-t border-forest-100 pt-8">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-xl text-ink-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
              "We don't have a budget."
            </h3>
            <p class="text-ink-700 text-body leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
              Worth checking. DigiLocal grants, PNRR Component 7, Regional Programme Nord-Vest and the NIS2 compliance lines all have windows open now or coming. The assessment tells you which lines you qualify for at this moment. If the answer is none of them, we tell you on day one.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-t border-forest-100 pt-8">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-xl text-ink-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
              "Our systems aren't online. Our staff aren't ready."
            </h3>
            <p class="text-ink-700 text-body leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
              That is exactly the situation the assessment is built for. Training your people is part of any implementation project, and we phase the technical work so the day-to-day change is gradual, not abrupt.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-t border-forest-100 pt-8">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-xl text-ink-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
              "How long does this actually take?"
            </h3>
            <p class="text-ink-700 text-body leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
              Assessment: one to three weeks. Grant application: two to four weeks. Implementation: three to nine months, depending on scope. Maintenance: ongoing, once the system is live.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-t border-forest-100 pt-8">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-xl text-ink-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
              "Will you split the contract to get it under a threshold?"
            </h3>
            <p class="text-ink-700 text-body leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
              No. Article 11 of Law 98/2016 prohibits splitting contracts to get around procurement thresholds, and we won't propose it. If your work goes over a threshold, we run the SEAP procedure that matches its size. It takes a few weeks longer, and it stays clean.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Compliance ribbon -->
  <section class="surface-dark py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="container-page">
      <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 md:gap-6">
        <div>
          <dt class="eyebrow text-forest-300 mb-2">Procurement</dt>
          <dd class="text-cream-50 text-body font-medium">SEAP registered, DUAE ready</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="eyebrow text-forest-300 mb-2">Legal compliance</dt>
          <dd class="text-cream-50 text-body font-medium">Law 242/2022</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="eyebrow text-forest-300 mb-2">Contract integrity</dt>
          <dd class="text-cream-50 text-body font-medium">Article 11, Law 98/2016</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="eyebrow text-forest-300 mb-2">Data protection</dt>
          <dd class="text-cream-50 text-body font-medium">GDPR, Romanian residency</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="surface-light section">
    <div class="container-page text-center">
      <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-6">005</div>
      <h2 class="font-sans font-medium text-display-2 text-ink-900 leading-tight mb-10 hang max-w-2xl mx-auto tracking-tight">
        Worth a half-hour<br/>conversation?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-ink-700 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-12">
        Tell us your city hall, roughly what you have in mind, and what has been tried before, if anything. We'll come back with the funding lines that look like a fit, and with what an assessment would cover.
      </p>
      <a href={u('/contact')} class="btn-primary">
        Start a conversation
        <svg class="btn-arrow" width="14" height="10" viewBox="0 0 14 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M0 5h12M8 1l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
